{"id":"vod_sn_38874","vodId":"38874","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"零之使魔","name_cn":"零之使魔","date":"2006-01-01","year":"2006","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/014dc0fb960ddc35634af8ad810d8463.jpg"},"summary":"魔法世界，托里斯特因魔法学院，年轻人在这里学习魔法课程。　　刚刚升入2年级的少女露易兹•德拉•瓦里埃尔因为一直以来施法成功率为0，被大家戏称为“零之露易兹”，她每次施法都无法成功，反而引起爆炸，把学院正常的学习生活搞的一团糟。　　这一天，是魔法师一生一次的使魔召唤仪式，召唤的使魔将会与魔法师永远在一起。其他学生都顺利完成了使魔的召唤，而露易兹咒语一出，毫无意外的发生了爆炸。不过，露易兹还是召唤出了一个使魔——一位人类！东京的少年才人竟然来到了魔法世界，并被当作一位使魔！　　不知所措的才人与不把才人当人看的露易兹签订了契约，在这个魔法学院，东京的普通少年才人，他的命运会怎么样呢。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 16:05:24","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/q0CCGJH3L41/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/wqyZru4yE31/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/fj3rARh2ww1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/q9qnNXZRLR1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/eYNR12SsW61/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/CV2SnhbnLC1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/ewkm5wdyHP1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/3zSJfE63JV1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ZXzHsR6RUk1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/644C7nVVv81/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/SqiV1mSgr81/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/8zScL4sfa61/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/77f2npbgWs1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:44:53.522Z"}